// aui.kwxts — kwxTypeScript port of wxSamples/src/aui/auidemo.cpp
//
// wxAUI demo/test application: a frame managed by wxAuiManager with five
// toolbars, ten docked/floating panes, a splittable wxAuiNotebook, and menus
// that exercise the manager, notebook and dock-art options.
//
// Run from the repository root:
//   bin\Release\kwxts.exe samples\aui\aui.kwxts
//
// The wxAuiManager::GetPane()/GetAllPanes().Item() bindings return borrowed
// pointers to the manager's own wxAuiPaneInfo objects, so panes are mutated in
// place exactly like the C++ sample does.  Layout save/load (wxAuiSerializer /
// wxAuiDeserializer) lives in layoutxml.kwxts.  The one structural
// substitution is wxSizeReportCtrl: it derives from wxControl in C++, which
// cannot be subclassed from a script, so it is a borderless wxPanel with the
// same paint/size handlers.

